# Codegen artifacts (mirrors monorepo's std/**/*.c convention — nova test
# writes generated .c/.exe/.obj next to source files it compiles).
src/**/*.c
src/**/*.exe
src/**/*.obj
src/**/*.pdb
src/**/*.ilk

# nova build/test scratch (obj dirs, libuv one-time build cache, lockfile
# resolution scratch under target/).
target/

# native/brotli/lib/ (Plan 205 followup, 2026-07-15 — same pattern as
# nova-tls's native/lib/ for mbedTLS, Plan 193 Ф.2 gate-3): auto-built
# brotlidec archive (vendor_src_dirs build-and-cache output) and its scratch
# obj dir — machine + toolchain specific, never committed (mirrors
# target/libuv-cache/ not being committed in the monorepo). A manually
# dropped-in prebuilt lib is likewise per-machine — don't commit either way.
# The vendored SOURCE this archive is built from (native/brotli/{dec,common,
# include}/) is NOT covered by this rule and IS committed.
native/brotli/lib/

# локальная обёртка сборки (пути машины разработчика)
nova.sh
